{
  "overview": "A reference and educational repository demonstrating Domain-Driven Design and hexagonal (ports-and-adapters) architecture using NestJS, GraphQL via Apollo, CQRS, and event-driven patterns, with PostgreSQL accessed via Slonik. It collects techniques and best practices for structuring backend applications rather than being a runnable product itself.",
  "tech_stack": [
    "TypeScript",
    "NestJS",
    "GraphQL",
    "PostgreSQL",
    "CQRS"
  ],
  "services": [
    "GraphQL API server"
  ],
